window.products.push({"id":371126,"name":"Nap Sleeping Neck Pillow, Memory Foam Slow Rebound U Shape for Traveling, School,Office. Sleeper Head/ Neck /Back Pain Support Pillow, Removable Ice S","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51oq1SX-csL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"LUXURY NAP SLEEPING DESK PILLOW - Provides therapeutic relief for all sleepers and arm/neck/head pain, you will wake up feeling fully recharged and ready to take the day. Its premium fabric to keep you cool and comfortable throughout the night. Lilihuahua Memory Foam Pillow gives you a nice and sweet dream ! QUALITY MATERIAL - Breathable memory foam provides better air circulation to keep you cool and dry. Our hypoallergenic rayon/polyester proprietary blend pillow case feels silky soft and smooth while provides dust mite protection. All material are chemical free for better health. Kindly pls note that real memory foam slow refound pillow ,if the shape is pressed, it takes 2-3 seconds to rebound,it is normal. SPECIFICATION -Size:11'' × 9.84'' × 5.11'' Weight: 0.7KG Color :Navy INCLUDED: ★1PC x Nap pillow--Beige memory foam (inner) +Navy Pillowcase (outer) ★1PC Eye mask for free for gift ★Our After-Sale Service--If you have any problem about the product.Please contact us firstly via email .We promise to reply you within 24 hours.Hope you have a pleasant shopping experience with us ! IMPORTANT NOTICE : NO 1. ✔ Please Upon arrival of your new bed pillow, remove the packaging and allow 24 hours until the pillow recovers its original shape. Kindly pls note that ,if memory foam have a little blowhole,don't worry ,This is the characteristic of all real memory foam pillow.but it is hided inside cover with pillowcase . NO 2.✔The contour pillow have hidden zipper, that allows you to extract the memory foam pillow. Remove foam to wash the breathable mesh cover. - Hand or Machine wash for pillow cover . PS :Don't wash the memory foam core inside! NO 3. Regarding Odor,due to the manufacturing processes of the memory foam, you might notice a smell. Rest assured that it is harmless and will dissipate around 1 week.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51oq1SX-csL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"YIHUAMAN","source_asin":"B0836XYK8K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-371126","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0836XYK8K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0836XYK8K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":371127,"name":"Chicology Cordless Cellular Shades / window blind fabric single cell, Honeycomb Cell, Privacy - Pebble, 30\"W X 64\"H","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71izlqFpUiL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","description":"Chicology Cordless Cellular Shades are pure. Pure in performance. Pure in appearance. By combining function with allure, Chicology Cellular Shades highlight any room. The honeycomb structure cells trap air keeping your house cool in the summer and warm in the winter; saving you money on your energy bill year round. 9/18-inch single cells do a marvelous job and look great too. The fabric is elegant yet durable. The cells open and close in an accordion fashion, with the simple lift or pull of a hand. Effortlessly cordless, the shade stays exactly where you want. Dressed in light bending fabrics that filter the light beautifully – our shades create gentle sun-cover during the day and valued privacy at night. The crisp fabric is available in three distinct colors: Mist (White), Croissant (Beige), and Pebble (Grey). All three colors come with matching head rail, fabric, and bottom rail – for a complete and finished look. Installation is easy. Just install the brackets to the wall or ceiling and clip the head rail on. Capable of both inside and outside mount, the width you purchase is exactly the width you get – there is no deduction. It is available in 3 different lengths: 48, 64, and 84.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71izlqFpUiL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CHICOLOGY","source_asin":"B07MHFWS6V","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-371127","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07MHFWS6V","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07MHFWS6V","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
