window.products.push({"id":371288,"name":"109Pcs Pampas Grass Boho Decor, 11 Kinds of Dried Flowers for DIY Decor Pompas Grass, 17\" Pampas Grass Tall for Boho Home Wedding Farmhouse Decor with","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.09,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71AijJ2nPAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"11 KINDS OF 109PCS - The dried flower bouquet has 11 varieties and comes with 109 luxuriant and lush dried pampas grass, including 15 White Reeds, 15 Natural Reeds, 2 Brown Decorative Feathers, 30 Pampas Grass, 15 White Bunny Tails, 15 Brown Bunny Tails, 5 Dried Wheat Stalks, 5 White Ball, 5 Dancing grass, 1 Baby's breath, 1 Illicium verum. A WIDE VARIETY - Our Pampas grasses are 17 inches in height and can be trimmed to any length to look great in various vase sizes. In addition, there are bunny tail grass, billy balls, babys breath, etc., in both variety and color, and with proper care, the dried bouquets are expected to last up to 3 years. BEAUTIFUL HOME AND WEDDING DECOR - Be ready for our attention-grabbing pampass grass to stand out in any room! Whether it be homes, offices, or weddings, our pampas grass fits effortlessly with boho, farmhouse, and modern-style decorations! CARE TIPS - It's perfectly normal for the pompas grass to shed when opening your parcel. However, for best results, place the pampas dried flower bouquet in the sun for 3-4 hours to fluff and reduce shedding before use. Naturally dried bouquets will have slight differences in size and color. WHY CHOOSE US - We are a professional flower and grass planting company, mainly pampas grass, and it has its farmland. We carefully select each dried pampas grass so that all buyers can appreciate the beauty of nature. In keeping with the love and respect for the art of dried flowers, the dried flowers undergo a rigorous quality check. Then, a professional Amazon team delivers them with a 30-day after-sales service.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71AijJ2nPAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tyynsst","source_asin":"B0BQC2D1C8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-371288","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BQC2D1C8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BQC2D1C8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
