window.products.push({"id":371307,"name":"HUMILABS 4500 Sq.ft Dehumidifiers for Large Room and Basements, Auto Shut Off and Defrost, 50 Pints Dehumidifier with Drain Hose and 135oz Water Tank,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":179.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/518v1JTwu2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【4,500 Sq. Ft Dehumidifier】Our 13.5 x 9.3 x 19.9 inches dehumidifier can remove up to 50 pints (under 95°F, 90%RH condition) of moisture every 24 hours, covers ups to 4,500 square feet and adjusts the humidity from 30% to 80%. It is a powerful dehumidifier ideal for large rooms, homes, basements, offices, bathrooms, bedrooms, kitchens, stockroom, living room, laundry room, crawlspace, etc. 【1.05 Gallon Water Tank & Continuous Drain Hose】Super easy to use! Adjust to your ideal humidity setting, then let it run continuously for it’s 24-hour cycle until the 1.05 gallon water tank is full. When full, the “Full\" Tank indicator light will turn red and automatically turn off to prevent water overflow. Tired of manual drainage? Also inclosed, is a 3.6ft long drain hose that fits over the drain hose outlet for continuous draining. 【Easy To Move & Portable】The HUMILABS dehumidifier is designed with a modern look. With 360° rotatable wheels and ergonomically designed hidden grip, you can move the basement dehumidifier from one room to another easily. It guarantees efficient dehumidification while being as easy to carry as many mini dehumidifiers around and allows you to maintain a comfortable and healthy environment anytime or anywhere! 【Intelligent Touch Control】This powerful dehumidifier comes with a digital display that provides accurate relative humidity (RH) and a 3-color humidity display light ring. 3-color humidity display light ring range: blue (<45%), green (45%~65%), red (≥65%). Simply adjust to your desire humidity level, when it reaches its desired humidity level, it will automatically stop and then automatically restart to dehumidify when it senses humidity level is above target. 【Ultra-silent Mode & Dry Clothes Mode】Featuring a low noise design, which is below 45dB, it runs quietly with no annoying sounds and will not disturb your work or binge-watching TV. Once turning the night mode on, you can enjoy quiet and undisturbed nights. In addition, the specially designed laundry dry mode is very suitable for wet weather so one can remove excessive moisture from clothes and keep them dry and clean. 【Two Year Warranty】Humilabs dehumidifiers come with TWO-YEAR warranty and 30-DAY free exchange or refund. If you encounter any problems, please feel free to contact us first. We have a professional technical support team and will response you in 24 hours and let you have an wonderful experience.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/518v1JTwu2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HUMILABS","source_asin":"B0BQ31X2Z6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-371307","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BQ31X2Z6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BQ31X2Z6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
