window.products.push({"id":371596,"name":"Batman Dark Knight Movie Print Poster Canvas in 5 Pieces","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51JtkkJQFzL._AC_.jpg","description":"NOTICE: about the difference between FRAMED and UNFRAMED. FRAMED: means its a framed canvas with a wooden frame around the canvas ready to hang on your wall. UNFRAMED: means it comes rolled up in a tube you need to find someone to frame it or you can do it yourself Each panel is plastic-sealed and comes with simple hanging wall nails. Bubble bag wrap + 4 corner protection This would be the perfect art piece for your living room, bedroom, kitchen, office, hotel, dining room, office, bathroom etc. This also might be the unique gift that you've been looking for your very special loved ones. Bright-white and smooth surface shows sharp details and vivid colour reproduction. Canvas has UV-protective coating. It is tightly stretched by hand. It has tight folded corners and mirrored edges so you don't lose any of your images, but it still wraps around the support frames. Image continues around the edges and it is ready to hang! This multi-piece canvas set will make your walls look cool! All products are available in different sizes and you may find the most appropriate size for your wall under the options. We inspect the artwork in every step of the finishing process, and then carefully pack your artwork to make sure it reaches you in the finest condition","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51JtkkJQFzL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"john psarris","source_asin":"B01EMGWF8W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-371596","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01EMGWF8W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01EMGWF8W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":371597,"name":"Spiralizer 5 Blade Vegetable Slicer, Strongest-and-heaviest duty, best veggie pasta noodles spiral cutter, vegetable pasta and spaghetti maker for low","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81bFClV5WzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Modology 5-blade spiraling vegetable slicer comes to you from our family owned home and kitchen company. The Modology 5-blade spiraling vegetable slicer is the brain-child of a couple with two small children determined to pair daily kitchen tools With optimal design and style. The husband in this dynamic duo is a top chef and the wife is an amateur in the kitchen. In their quest to create fun and innovative ways to get her kids to eat their veggies, designing a top-of-the-line, durable and kitchen friendly 5-blade vegetable spiraling slicer was on the top of their list. Traveling across the globe to trade shows and working closely with their manufacturer, The Modology spiraling 5-blade vegetable slicer was born. With a sleek, pre-assembled and ready-to-use design, The Modology 5-blade slicer makes creating healthy, gluten-free, paleo, and vegan dishes an artistic breeze. Using only the strongest, Sturdiest, and safest materials, The hassle that used to exist in trying to come up with fun ways to get veggies into a meal is over. From our hearts to your kitchen, The Modology spiraling 5-blade vegetable slicer is a quality, trusted, 4th generation model. Taking the best from existing products and adding commercial grade quality stainless steel blades, The Modology spiraling 5-blade vegetable slicer allows you to turn your food into pure culinary magic. The affordability factor does not take away from the high quality of our slicer and, with the dishwasher safe* materials, clean up is a breeze. You can easily store the Modology slicer as it fits into any cabinet. Or, you can display it proudly as it is sure to create a buzz with family and friends who want to know your secret for creating such gorgeous yet healthy meals.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81bFClV5WzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Modology","source_asin":"B076B7RRP6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-371597","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B076B7RRP6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B076B7RRP6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
