window.products.push({"id":371652,"name":"Scottish Thistle Cooking Baking Apron - Scottish Gifts with Unique Artwork on Plaid Background","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/01RmK+J4pJL._AC_.gif","description":"This Scottish Thistle plaid apron is sourced from Scotland by our family-run US company. Scotland, like the USA, is a land of beautiful scenery, wide open spaces and friendly people. Also like the USA, Scotland's history has been forged through a long battle with England which has been both won and lost over the years through sword, shield and war. Scotland also had to fight off the invasions of the Norse Viking men and so is really, a true-life version of the hit TV shows like Outlander and Game of Thrones which often shoot there. That heritage and history coupled with Scotland’s iconic national flower, the Thistle, has inspired this unique, colorful and stylish apron with its distinctive Scottish Thistle Bunting design which is perfect for when you’re in the kitchen whilst cooking or baking, stoking and grilling the BBQ in the backyard or even just when you have messy tasks to deal with in the home! Its bright and striking colors will not only make it a wonderful addition to your home but will also make a wonderful gift for a friend or relative with a link to any of Scotland's Celtic clan or even just for those fans of Outlander! They are ideal for home, commercial and industrial uses and are suitable for adults, men, women, waitress, waiters, artists, chef or even butchers. They are made from high quality premium 100% Cotton fabric with black straps and ties. The standard size will fits most adults. This authentic apron can also be paired with other products in our range including its twin Thistle Bunting mug or even our Scottish Stag mug, Highland Cow mug or Scottie Dog mug. A purchase of one, some or all of these products for you or as Scottish gifts for friends and family will provide you with not only a high quality product but will also give you the most original, memorable and striking range of mugs in the USA whilst celebrating the heritage of our forefathers from the old country.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/01RmK+J4pJL._AC_.gif","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Scott Inness","source_asin":"B07V4CQH6X","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-371652","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07V4CQH6X","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07V4CQH6X","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
