window.products.push({"id":371655,"name":"bioGo Bottle (500ml) | Premium Stainless Steel Reusable Water Bottles | BPA-Free, Double Wall Insulation Metal Vacuum Flask | 12 Hours Hot & 24 Hours ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Wmy4Fn1JL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"24 HOURS COLD - 12 HOURS HOT: A more versatile bottle simply doesn't exist. Using advanced double wall vacuum insulation, your favourite drink can be kept cold for up to 24 hours or hot for 12 hours no matter what the outside temperature is! This makes our bottles the most usable reusables on the market. LEAK-PROOF: Designed with an airtight and leak-proof lid to prevent any spills. No leaks, guaranteed. ECO-FRIENDLY & DURABLE: We use premium, food-grade 304 (18/8) stainless steel, a metal recognised for its strength and purity. It also protects against flavour transfer. BPA-free, phthalate-free, toxin-free. Invest today and stop using single-use plastic bottles which are bad for you and the environment. TAKE IT EVERYWHERE: The bioGo Bottle's stylish, sophisticated and resilient design is lightweight & the narrow mouth makes it easy to drink out of on the go, whilst still being large enough to fit ice cubes in. Our personal favourite is a banana milkshake! Perfect for office dwellers, gym-goers and outdoors adventurers. CONDENSATION, SWEAT FREE EXTERIOR: Designed for an active urban lifestyle, the bioGo Bottle will never cause water rings on your office desk, slippery hands at the gym or a damp mess in your bag. This bottle would serve you well camping or hiking too.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Wmy4Fn1JL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"bioGo","source_asin":"B07JG8MRZH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-371655","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07JG8MRZH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07JG8MRZH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
