window.products.push({"id":371708,"name":"Amélie Home Teddy Throw Pillow Covers Decorative Boucle Textured Wool Like Pillow Covers for Chair and Couch, 18 X 18 Inch, Light Grey","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/816RKKYwEmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Polyester EXQUISITE DESIGN: With a two-sided modern boucle textured design, Amelie Home teddy faux fur Throw Pillows with an invisible zipper will add a pop of style and elegance to your home. It will be a good decoration for you to update your room, suitable for bedroom, living room, bed, sofa, couch. Match well with your living space. PREMIUM MATERIALS: With a faux-fur material similar to a teddy bear, Amelie Home Set of 2 teddy faux fur pillow covers are extra comfy and beautifully textured with a perfect curly wool look. Our fuzzy modern boucle textured throw pillow covers reversible are made of 100% polyester, super soft, and skin-friendly. INSPIRATION: Amelie Home takes inspiration from a French concept of Love and Passion for designing our products in the most stylish and elegant way. Unveiling a French secret of elegance and design, we create our home decor and accessories to reflect the most mysterious and romantic feeling of being in love. IDEAL HOME DECOR: Soft, plush, and oh-so-cozy, this cute fuzzy pillow cover will be a great home decor for a modern sofa or your bedroom. You can pair it with Amelie Home throw blankets together for the ultimate cuddle-up. It also will be an ideal gift for your friends and loved ones, and for Valentine's Day, and other occasions. EASY CARE: Including 2 pillow covers(COVERS ONLY NO INSERTS). As the fur is fluffy and curly, please tidy up the fur when you zip this teddy pillow cover. The shake helps to stretch the teddy boucle fur and fluff out excess fluff when the pillow is fitted. The throw pillow covers made of machine-washable polyester are durable and easy to care for. We recommend washing in cold water with a gentle detergent (no fabric softener). Tumble dry on your lowest dryer setting with low heat (do not iron).","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/816RKKYwEmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Amélie Home","source_asin":"B09MVLJ7CR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-371708","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09MVLJ7CR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09MVLJ7CR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
