window.products.push({"id":371784,"name":"Yamazaki Epoch 65-Piece Stainless Steel Flatware Set with Wooden Tray, Service for 12","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31Z5TXAGQBL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description The company known as Yamazaki Tableware Inc. began as a family business in 1918 producing metal items crafted of copper, silver and brass. In 1932 they pioneered the production of stainless steel flatware, functioning as the factory of choice for many flatware companies. In 1980, Yamazaki introduced their own line of 18/8 carefully designed stainless steel flatware under the Yamazaki brand. Amazon.com With its straight lines and eye-catching angles, Yamazaki Epoch flatware lets you set a smart table with a minimum of fuss. Each piece features an elongated, flared handle with faceted sides and a squared-off tip. The designs profile is low and unobtrusive, while the gleaming mirror finish adds a bit of dash. Crafted from 18/8 stainless steel, Epoch is corrosion-resistant, highly durable, and safe in the dishwasher. An excellent entertaining set, this 65-piece collection includes 12 place settings, each with a 6-3/4-inch salad fork, an 8-inch dinner fork, a 9-1/4-inch knife, an 8-inch soupspoon, and a 6-1/2-inch teaspoon. The five pieces in the serving set--a serving spoon, a serving fork, a slotted spoon, a sugar spoon, and a butter knif--are well balanced and pleasant to handle. The entire collection stores in the included wooden caddy, which measures 16-1/4 by 12-1/4 by 2-3/4 inches. As with its other patterns, Yamazaki backs Epoch with a lifetime warranty against defects. --Emily Bedard What's in the Box 12 place settings, 5 serving pieces. Each place setting consists of: salad fork; dinner fork; knife; soupspoon; teaspoon. Service set consists of: serving spoon; serving fork; slotted spoon; sugar spoon; butter knife. 65 pieces total.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31Z5TXAGQBL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Yamazaki","source_asin":"B0000C1HJ6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-371784","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0000C1HJ6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0000C1HJ6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
