window.products.push({"id":371843,"name":"GARNECK Cars Ornament 9pcs Wooden Christmas Ornaments Red Truck and Car Cutout for Xmas Holiday Decor Stocking Stuffer Gifts","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":10.73,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61aIKSsOc+L._AC_SL1202_.jpg","description":"Description These decorative Christmas hanging pendants will add luster to your Christmas party. Hang these cute decorations to decorate Christmas trees, fireplaces, doors, walls, windows or give them as gifts to your family and friends. They will bring you joy and festive atmosphere. Features - Material: Wooden- Make your home unique with the hanging decor, and add more fun to your daily life Package Including 1 Set/9pcs x Christmas pendants with 3 patterns","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61aIKSsOc+L._AC_SL1202_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Garneck","source_asin":"B08JLNN831","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-371843","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08JLNN831","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08JLNN831","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":371844,"name":"Lodge Cast Iron Cornstick Pan, Pre-Seasoned, 5-stick,Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/4168ZGTBSBL._AC_.jpg","description":"So you want to make perfect cornbread? Then this 5-slot pan is for you. The individual cornsticks, shaped like ears of corn, are a traditional favorite for generations. These crispy crusted darlin’s leave your guests yellin’ for more. Great with soups, stews and chili. Cast Iron is ideal for that perfect cornbread crust, not too thick, not too dark. Unique cooking properties of Cast Iron cook evenly without hot spots. Sporting a stylish black color, the cast iron pan looks good in most kitchens and it doubles up as an excellent source of nutritional iron. This pre-seasoned pan is ready-to-use right out of the box. While the pan comes pre-seasoned to prevent food from sticking, it works best when sprayed or lightly coated with vegetable oil before use. The Lodge seasoning procedure is a multiple-step process in which the seasoning oil is applied via an electrostatic spray system that coats the cookware, then it’s baked in commercial ovens at very high temperatures. This allows the oil to penetrate deeply into the pores of the iron. This seasoning process achieves a seasoned finish that would take many months of home use to achieve. The factory seasoning process makes Lodge cast iron products ready to use right out of the box, and the product over time “Just keeps getting better”. After cooking, clean with a stiff nylon brush and hot water. Using soap is not recommended, and harsh detergents should never be used. Towel dry immediately and apply a light coating of oil to utensil while it is still warm. Cast Iron, like your grandmother used, still ranks as one of the best cooking utensils ever made. It gives you a nearly non-stick surface, without the possible harmful fumes generated by preheating chemically treated nonstick cookware. The American-based company, Lodge, has been fine-tuning its construction of rugged, cast-iron cookware for more than a century.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/4168ZGTBSBL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lodge","source_asin":"B00P0J96U6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-371844","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00P0J96U6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00P0J96U6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
