window.products.push({"id":371963,"name":"Tzuki Pour Over Drip Kettle (1.2L) - Gooseneck Tea and Coffee Kettle with Built-In Thermometer for Enhanced Flavor and Aroma - Easy to Use and Dishwas","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81RuslHE7xL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Discover the Difference of a Slow Pour! Home-brewing coffee is a great way to save money and ensure your drink is served just the way you like it. Unfortunately, heating your water to the proper temperature can be a bit of a guessing game, resulting in scorched beans and tasteless coffee. Enjoy rich, flavor-filled drinks with the Pour Over Drip Kettle by Tzuki! Gooseneck kettles have long been staples in coffee-lovers’ kitchens. The unique design slows the pouring process, giving you more control for a smoother drink and fewer messes. When a little extra care goes into each cup, your coffee and tea will be teeming with flavor! But what truly sets our kettle apart is the built-in thermometer! Clear and easy-to-read, you can pour water at exactly the right temperature for bold, full-bodied taste and aroma. Featuring an ergonomic, heat-resistant handle, it’s safe and comfortable to use. When you’re all done, simply rinse it out or add it to the dishwasher for a cleanup that couldn’t be easier. At Tzuki, we’re dedicated to creating products that look as good as they work! That’s why we use premium stainless steel. It’s stylishly sleek, lightweight and incredibly durable, so you can rely on it day in and day out. Why Choose Our Gooseneck Kettle? - Allows for slower pours- Built-in temperature gauge- Sleek, lightweight design- Safe in the dishwasher- Made with premium stainless steel Try Today Risk-Free with Our Money Back Guarantee! *Stock is limited. Order today to ensure availability. Order Your Pour Over Kettle Now for Smooth, Rich Taste!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81RuslHE7xL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tzuki","source_asin":"B01IQRBIHC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-371963","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01IQRBIHC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01IQRBIHC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
