window.products.push({"id":371980,"name":"Butterfly Bronze Memorial Keepsake Urns - Extra Small - Holds Up to 3 Cubic Inches of Ashes - Cloisonne Blue Cremation Urn for Ashes","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":125.83,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/516jgpCYovL._AC_.jpg","description":"This adorable little blue cloisonne style keepsake heart is perfect way to tie your loved one's enjoyment of the flowers and butterflies in life into their memorial item. The heart contains a discrete cap in the back of the urn for adding ash, and will remain securely closed once ashes are inside.Brass is a lightweight metal alloy made of 90% copper and 10% zinc. It gives off a bright golden appearance when polished. Oftentimes, brass cremation urns are finished with bronze or pewter to strengthen the brass and to alter the color. The bronze finish has a more reddish hue, whereas the pewter finish gives off a silver hue. Brass is also easy to cast in a mold as it is a malleable material that can be coated in enamel or paint. It is used in multiple capacities for a wide variety of purposes and has a long history as a favored material for everything from cookery to fine art to metal cremation urns. Our brass cremation urns showcase the fine balance this diverse material offers. The beauty and functionality of brass have given it a high standing among metals and alloys, and it is among the most popular choices in our large selection of cremation urns for ashes.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/516jgpCYovL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"OneWorld Memorials","source_asin":"B06WVF26GF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-371980","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B06WVF26GF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B06WVF26GF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
